  "Header":               "MMC-EDP-V2.5",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Entity Dialogue Processing in the Voice Command Interface: what an application did, or why it did not, or what it needs from the person, arrives as the Response Hint (the Refined Text), and the machine says it - briefly, from the Response Hint only, knowing nothing of the application. The Text Object is what the person said, when it is there. The reply is the Machine Text; the dialogue memory is the Summary.",

